				<h2 id="objet">1. Purpose and acceptance</h2>
				<p>
					These terms govern access to and use of the LibertAI services, provided by
					<strong>Intelligence Artificielle Générale SAS</strong>, an SAS with share capital of €10,000, 76 Promenade
					des Anglais, 94210 Saint-Maur-des-Fossés, RCS Créteil 985 392 356, VAT FR36985392356 (hereinafter “LibertAI”,
					“we”).
				</p>
				<p>
					The services comprise the libertai.io website, the chat application (chat.libertai.io), the console
					(console.libertai.io), the inference API and the search service.
				</p>
				<p>
					The <strong>LiberClaw</strong> agent platform is subject to separate terms, available at
					<a href="https://liberclaw.ai" rel="noopener" target="_blank">liberclaw.ai</a>.
				</p>
				<p>Creating an account or making any payment constitutes acceptance of these terms.</p>

				<h2 id="compte">2. Account and eligibility</h2>
				<p>An account can be created in two ways:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						<strong>with an email address</strong>, directly or via Google or GitHub;
					</li>
					<li><strong>with a wallet</strong>, by means of a signature.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					You must be at least 18 years old, or have the authorization of your legal representative, and have the legal
					capacity to enter into contracts. You are responsible for keeping your credentials, your API keys and your
					wallet confidential.
					<strong
						>Loss of access to a wallet is irreversible and cannot be remedied by any restoration on LibertAI's part.</strong
					>
				</p>

				<h2 id="services">3. Description of the services</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>
						<strong>Inference</strong> — access to open-weight artificial intelligence models via an OpenAI-compatible API
						and via the chat interface, billed on a usage basis.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Subscription plans</strong> — usage allowances renewed over rolling periods, according to the plan subscribed
						to.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Prepaid credits</strong> — a balance denominated in United States dollars, consumed as calls are made.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Pay-per-request</strong> — payment for a single call, without an account.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Search</strong> — web search service accessible via API.
					</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					The model catalog, the models' unit prices and their characteristics change over time; they are published in
					the console and the documentation. A model may be withdrawn, in particular when its publisher changes the
					terms applicable to it.
				</p>

				<h2 id="prix">4. Prices</h2>
				<p>
					The applicable prices are those displayed at the time of the order. Prices displayed to consumers residing in
					the European Union are
					<strong>inclusive of all taxes</strong>, the applicable VAT being shown at checkout. Prices displayed outside
					the European Union are exclusive of any taxes that may be due in your country of residence.
				</p>
				<p>
					Inference rates are expressed per million tokens processed or per image generated, and vary by model. They may
					change for an objective reason: a change in the cost of computing resources, a change in licensing or pricing
					by a model's publisher, or a change in applicable taxes. Any change
					<strong>has no effect on credits already purchased or on the current subscription period</strong>. You are
					notified of it before it takes effect; if it does not suit you, you may terminate free of charge before that
					date.
				</p>

				<h2 id="paiement">5. Payment</h2>
				<p>Two payment methods are offered:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						<strong>Bank card or bank transfer</strong>, through our payment service provider. Card data does not pass
						through our servers.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Crypto-assets</strong>, for accounts created with a wallet. Payment is made by an on-chain
						transaction, part of which is destroyed (<em>burn</em>) and the remainder transferred to LibertAI.
					</li>
				</ul>
				<p>Accounts created with a wallet cannot pay by card; accounts created by email cannot pay in crypto-assets.</p>
				<div class="note">
					<p style="margin:0">
						<strong>Crypto-asset transactions.</strong> A transaction recorded on a blockchain is
						<strong>irreversible</strong>: it cannot be cancelled by LibertAI or by any third party. It is your
						responsibility to check the network, the amount and the address before confirming. Funds sent to an
						incorrect address, on an unsupported network, or by means of an asset that is not accepted are permanently
						lost. The value of crypto-assets is volatile; the amount credited corresponds to the equivalent value
						observed at the time the transaction is confirmed.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="note">
					<p style="margin:0">
						<strong>LibertAI is not a crypto-asset service provider.</strong> LibertAI does not provide any of the crypto-asset
						services defined in Article 3(1), point (16), of Regulation (EU) 2023/1114 (MiCA), including providing custody
						and administration of crypto-assets on behalf of clients, operating a trading platform for crypto-assets, exchanging
						crypto-assets for funds, executing orders for crypto-assets on behalf of clients, providing advice on crypto-assets
						or providing portfolio management on crypto-assets. LibertAI is not registered under that Regulation and is not
						required to be. Crypto-asset payments are made directly from your wallet to the network; LibertAI at no time has
						access to your private keys or custody of your assets.
					</p>
				</div>
				<p>
					The service is credited once payment is confirmed. In the event of non-payment, rejection or chargeback,
					access may be suspended until the situation is remedied.
				</p>

				<h2 id="abonnements">6. Subscriptions</h2>
				<p>
					Subscriptions are taken out for a term of one month and renew automatically, with payment collected by the
					payment provider, until terminated.
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						<strong>Termination:</strong> possible at any time from your account. It takes effect at the end of the current
						period; the service remains accessible until that date and no further payment is collected.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Change of plan:</strong> an upgrade takes effect immediately, with the unused portion of the previous
						plan credited as prepaid credits. A downgrade takes effect at the end of the current period.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Only one active subscription</strong> per account.
					</li>
					<li>
						The usage allowances attached to a plan are valid over rolling periods and
						<strong>cannot be carried over</strong> from one period to the next. Once the allowance is used up, consumption
						is charged against the prepaid credit balance.
					</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					A free tier, with limited allowances, is offered. It may be modified or discontinued at any time and is not
					subject to any availability commitment.
				</p>

				<h2 id="credits">7. Prepaid credits</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>
						Credits are denominated in United States dollars and constitute neither electronic money nor a means of
						payment usable outside the LibertAI services.
					</li>
					<li>
						Purchased credits <strong>do not expire</strong>. Free or promotional credits may have a validity date,
						indicated when they are granted; they are consumed first.
					</li>
					<li>
						Credits are neither assignable, nor transferable, nor redeemable for cash, subject to the provisions of
						Section 8.
					</li>
				</ul>

				<h2 id="retractation">8. Right of withdrawal (consumers)</h2>
				<p>
					Consumers have a period of fourteen days from the conclusion of the contract in which to exercise their right
					of withdrawal, in accordance with Article L.221-18 of the French Consumer Code.
				</p>
				<p>
					The LibertAI services constitute a supply of digital content and digital services whose performance begins
					immediately. In accordance with Article L.221-28, 13° of the same Code, by confirming your order you
					<strong>expressly request immediate performance</strong> of the service and
					<strong>waive your right of withdrawal</strong> for the part of the service already performed. This consent is explicitly
					requested from you at the time of payment.
				</p>
				<p>
					The unperformed part — a subscription not yet started, credits purchased and not consumed — remains refundable
					during the fourteen-day period. Requests should be sent to
					<a href="mailto:contact@libertai.io">contact@libertai.io</a> and the refund is made within fourteen days of receipt
					of the request, using the same means of payment.
				</p>
